  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "InternData-A1-LeRobot-v3.0-by-embodiment",
  "description": "InternData-A1 dataset taken from InternRobotics/InternData-A1,\nwith the tarballs extracted and directory structure \"transposed\" so that the top-level subdirectories are the four embodiments.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tTwo franka dirs\n\t\n\nFor the franka embodiment, there are two different feature spaces, so we split it into the franka-1 and franka-2 directories.\nThe feature spaces differ in image shape and gripper value range.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tMinor fixes\n\t\n\nSome subsets such as\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/griffinlabs/InternData-A1-LeRobot-v3.0-by-embodiment.",
  "alternateName": [
    "griffinlabs/InternData-A1-LeRobot-v3.0-by-embodiment",
    "InternData-A1 (LeRobot v3.0; by embodiment)"
  ],
